From 3759ec97278abb58eeff0da31c3736b66a02b3de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sachin <sachinbarange86@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:18:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Force the mod_device _global check to true

The capability resolver probes ro.product.mod_device for "_global" and falls back to a restricted feature set when it misses. On a non-Turbo device the probe always misses, so the flag is forced on. Ported from the Dyper patched build.

Signed-off-by: Sachin <sachinbarange86@gmail.com>
---
 smali_classes5/v7/c.smali | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/smali_classes5/v7/c.smali b/smali_classes5/v7/c.smali
index 33d46931..7dc7ce5c 100644
--- a/smali_classes5/v7/c.smali
+++ b/smali_classes5/v7/c.smali
@@ -234,6 +234,8 @@
 
     move-result v0
 
+    const/4 v0, 0x1
+
     sput-boolean v0, Lv7/c;->m:Z
 
     const-string v0, "ro.boot.hwc"
-- 
2.43.0

